e": "3.png", "id": "3259264544227888", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624744_3259264547561221_4452318315298865842_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=daW8RMv5SycQ7kNvwFKAaeq&_nc_oc=AdpUeIlY5FmgY27-J5p8dWANcLE_GarmqFL3h2nkHu8ba03dqGv0BBhw_2FvD_IsU_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGu69UhbDTR9BY89qC9RoFPDYrdJpiuOt3L9TcXqaDe5w&oe=6A857FB7"}, "display_name": "Punchverse VR", "keywords": ["VRBoxingGame", "VRFitness", "ArcadeBoxingVR", "VRWorkout"], "long_description": "Punchverse VR\n\nStep into the ring like never before! Punchverse VR is an immersive virtual reality boxing challenge where your speed, reflexes, and endurance are put to the ultimate test.\n\nCore Features:\n\nIntense Punch Challenges \u2013 Hit targets with precision while avoiding costly misses.\n\nDynamic Progression \u2013 Survive as long as you can; every miss brings you closer to game over.\n\nImmersive Audio & Music \u2013 Energetic voice lines, punch feedback, and adaptive music keep you pumped.\n\nLeaderboards \u2013 Track your performance and compete with others for the top score.\n\nArcade-Style Replayability \u2013 Quick to start, hard to master, and always addictive.\n\nWhether you\u2019re warming up, competing for high scores, or just blowing off steam, Punchverse VR delivers a fun, fast-paced boxing experience right inside your headset.", "short_description": "Step into the ring like never before! Punchverse VR is an immersive virtual reality boxing challenge where your speed, reflexes, and endurance are put to the ultimate test."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OCqMZ736rfvTwXnk_mAO73hXMKDrcTNWSAGpozxf2zk/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Paranoma 3D", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/paranoma3D", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tag